    "description": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Replaced a shell command substitution in `skills/heartbeat/SKILL.md` step 4 detection-method #2 with the `${today}` template variable that the workflow already injects. Same string, no behavioral change — just removes one more `$(...)` site the runner shell-guard would block."
